## 4. Latency Budget & 2–3s SLA Breakdown

To guarantee complete execution in under 3 seconds for up to 5 receipts simultaneously:

| Pipeline Stage | Sequential (Naive) | Parallel Async (Our Architecture) | SLA Budget |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **1. Client-to-Server Ingress** | 100–300 ms | 100–300 ms | 300 ms |
| **2. Image In-Memory Preprocessing** | 5 × 120 ms = 600 ms | **120 ms (concurrent)** | 200 ms |
| **3. AI Multimodal Vision Inference** | 5 × 1200 ms = 6,000 ms *(Fails SLA)* | **1,100–1,500 ms (concurrent)** | 1,800 ms |
| **4. Raw JSON Persistence** | 5 × 20 ms = 100 ms | **20 ms (concurrent)** | 50 ms |
| **5. Business Logic Filtering** | 5 × 5 ms = 25 ms | **5 ms (in-memory)** | 10 ms |
| **6. Server-to-Client Egress & Render** | 50 ms | **50 ms** | 100 ms |
| **TOTAL TURNAROUND TIME** | **~7,000 ms (7.0s ❌)** | **~1,400–2,100 ms (1.4–2.1s ✅)** | **< 3.0s** |

